   "coverage_note": "I rechecked the material and territorial scope, definitions, lawful grounds, consent, sensitive-information exceptions, principles, transparency, records, security, impact assessment and all outward-transfer routes. I also read Article 20 and Annex I identified by the coverage warning; scientific research and Annex I's Subregion listing do not change the analysis. The A1 answers resolve the health-care/professional-secrecy route, the treatment consent exception, the genetic-information bar on Article 19(1)(a), the non-application of A1 hosting/storage conditions, and the non-engagement of A1's listed impact-assessment categories. The remaining decisive issue is the Article 18 Region B law-and-practice assessment, with the Article 19(1)(b) contract route also factually unresolved."
  }
